      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Cook for a further 4–5 minutes to ensure the rice is cooked, finish with chopped parsley, Mascarpone, grated Parmesan and seasoning.  Assembly  Serve in a large bowl with grated cheese and olive oil drizzled over the top."
    }
  ]
